<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-07T20:22:20.183Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 20:22:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran launched a missile that struck a building in Tel Aviv and warned it would reopen the Strait of Hormuz if U.S. conditions are met, while the United States carried out fresh strikes on Iran's Qeshm Island. Tehran delivered a secret Khamenei message to Putin as Moscow pushes a gas pipeline deal and sent a nuclear proposal to the United States via Qatar, reviewing concrete proposals on its nuclear programme. South Korea is extending anti-piracy patrols closer to the Strait of Hormuz and Saudi coalition forces intercepted a missile aimed at Medina. 123 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/07/us-carries-out-another-round-of-minor-strikes-on-iran-trump-says&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/07/strait-of-hormuz-qatar-plan-iran-nuclear-inspections&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/iran-delivers-secret-khamenei-message-to-putin-as-moscow-pushes-gas-pipeline-deal&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/05/world/middleeast/peace-talks-iran-united-states-qatar-nuclear-program.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/05/south-korea-plans-to-extend-anti-piracy-patrols-closer-to-strait-of-hormuz&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOdElJT2IxV2wwQlBQVG9NaEo3MlZDblRVLWliMjE1dDYxd1hSYU5DVXFZdVpfQXdJR2tzOGo4LXBxdExUOXlWZWUtUkFER25sbGNnbG84U01Cd2N1NnpkM3lUVVRtcmMzNnNnbVV4bWcyUUhsSTdhRTRMM25sTGQ1MThVZGx6QU04akMyZ0pUcHlsdXMtUVZ6MXRvQ09Ia2d6X2dYdHlVU0dFZ2hRa0piNzdn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6d091ev3p0jo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campai